abstract: >-
  CALIPER is a reproducible research artifact for designing, executing, and
  analyzing factorial LLM evaluation experiments with explicit attention to
  variance and ranking stability. Release v1.0.0 archives the Paper 1 HumanEval+
  frozen statistical dataset (N=39,360) under artifacts/paper1/, together with
  freeze/integrity documentation, GLMM/variance exports, and analysis-reproduction
  scripts. Zenodo DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21780089.
